@startuml
!include ../styl.iuml
[*] --> DEV_UNBOUND : device_create_of()
DEV_UNBOUND --> DEV_BOUND : probe = 0
DEV_UNBOUND --> DEV_DEFERRED : probe = -EPROBE_DEFER
DEV_UNBOUND --> DEV_FAILED : probe < 0 (inny błąd)
DEV_DEFERRED --> DEV_BOUND : retry_deferred, probe = 0
DEV_FAILED --> DEV_BOUND : nowy pasujący sterownik
DEV_BOUND --> DEV_UNBOUND : driver_unregister (remove, devres)
DEV_BOUND --> [*] : device_destroy
@enduml
